    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In the fading light of 1999, the peaceful streets of Greenhart City were shrouded in darkness. On its outskirts stood the majestic Rogue Mansion, an opulent residence once inhabited by the esteemed couple Lazarus and Catherine Rogue. Known for their power, wealth, and influence, they were the pillars of the community. However, tragedy struck when Catherine succumbed to an incurable illness, leaving Lazarus broken and consumed by grief. Overcome by despair, Lazarus chooses to end his own life within the mansion's grand walls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Shortly after, unexplained disappearances, strange sightings, and disasters centered around the mansion began gripping the city. Nobody who has ventured inside to investigate the link has returned. The people of Greenhart need a hero.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ROGUE MANSION is a survival horror game combined with the best of the roguelike genre! Explore a procedurally generated mansion that is different every time you play, becoming increasingly dangerous and unpredictable as you delve deeper into its depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the game in different ways, by choosing from multiple unique characters - each with their own equipment, special perks, and motivations. Switch between first-person or third-person perspectives at any time in order to remix how you see and approach challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your resources, solve puzzles, fight all kinds of unworldly creatures, and find a way out while you unravel the mysteries of the mansion. Making progress rewards you with the ability to unlock new weapons, special items, alternate costumes, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an intense, unsettling atmosphere, created by a stylish PS2Plus retro aesthetic; a combination of models, polygons, and textures faithfully created like in the PS2 era of gaming, embellished to match how great these looked in your memories by using modern graphical effects.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In the fading light of 1999, the peaceful streets of Greenhart City were shrouded in darkness. On its outskirts stood the majestic Rogue Mansion, an opulent residence once inhabited by the esteemed couple Lazarus and Catherine Rogue. Known for their power, wealth, and influence, they were the pillars of the community. However, tragedy struck when Catherine succumbed to an incurable illness, leaving Lazarus broken and consumed by grief. Overcome by despair, Lazarus chooses to end his own life within the mansion's grand walls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Shortly after, unexplained disappearances, strange sightings, and disasters centered around the mansion began gripping the city. Nobody who has ventured inside to investigate the link has returned. The people of Greenhart need a hero.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ROGUE MANSION is a survival horror game combined with the best of the roguelike genre! Explore a procedurally generated mansion that is different every time you play, becoming increasingly dangerous and unpredictable as you delve deeper into its depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the game in different ways, by choosing from multiple unique characters - each with their own equipment, special perks, and motivations. Switch between first-person or third-person perspectives at any time in order to remix how you see and approach challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your resources, solve puzzles, fight all kinds of unworldly creatures, and find a way out while you unravel the mysteries of the mansion. Making progress rewards you with the ability to unlock new weapons, special items, alternate costumes, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an intense, unsettling atmosphere, created by a stylish PS2Plus retro aesthetic; a combination of models, polygons, and textures faithfully created like in the PS2 era of gaming, embellished to match how great these looked in your memories by using modern graphical effects.</p>",
    "short_description": "An unexplained tragedy brings together the fate of a group of strangers, inside an ever-shifting mansion of horrors. ROGUE MANSION is the classic survival horror revival you've been waiting for, combined with roguelike mechanics for endless replayability.",
